# 1️⃣1️⃣ FROM SCRATCH — IMPLEMENT MEAN & VARIANCE

Don't depend on NumPy yet.

```python
data = [2, 4, 6, 8, 10]

# Mean
mean = sum(data) / len(data)

# Variance
